## Variable not bound in every alternative

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A content integer
  -- B content integer
  -- F

declaration scope S:
  context e content E
  output o content integer

scope S:
  definition e equals A content 1
  definition o equals match e with pattern
    -- A content x or F: x
    -- B content y: y
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope S
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  The variable x is bound in pattern A but not in pattern F.
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_unbound_var.catala_en:16.18-19:
│    │
│ 16 │     -- A content x or F: x
│    │                  ‾
├─ Variable not bound in every alternative
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_unbound_var.catala_en:16.23-24:
│    │
│ 16 │     -- A content x or F: x
│    │                       ‾
└─ Variable not bound in every alternative
#return code 123#
```
